# ================================================================
# Solo Leveling Hunter RPG Bot — Environment Configuration
# ================================================================

# Telegram Bot API Token obtained from @BotFather
# 1. Message @BotFather on Telegram (https://t.me/BotFather)
# 2. Run /newbot and follow instructions to name your bot
# 3. Copy the generated API token here:
BOT_TOKEN=1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz

# Private Telegram Channel ID used as the persistent database
# 1. Create a new private Telegram channel (e.g., "Hunter Database")
# 2. Add your bot into the channel as an Administrator (with "Post Messages" and "Edit Messages" rights)
# 3. Obtain the channel ID (starts with -100, e.g. -1001234567890):
#    - Forward any message from the channel to @userinfobot or @JsonDumpBot, or
#    - Use web.telegram.org and copy the ID from the URL
DATA_CHANNEL_ID=-1001234567890
